			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Commander Ashlam Valorfist leads the {link:alliance}Alliance{/link} in {link:western-plaguelands}the Western Plaguelands{/link}. When {link:stormwind-city}Stormwind{/link} sent out its call to arms against the {link:scourge}Scourge{/link} of the north, it was to his camp that the volunteers were sent. He is a bold and loud man, fond of plans and of praise, and he means to take {link:ruins-of-andorhal}Andorhal{/link} back from the dead.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Valorfist is the sword of the {link:alliance}Alliance{/link} in the dead lands of {link:lordaeron}Lordaeron{/link}. His campaign is the first real attempt by {link:stormwind-city}Stormwind{/link} to strike at the {link:scourge}Scourge{/link} in its own country since the kingdom fell.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• He built {link:chillwind-camp}Chillwind Camp{/link} and called volunteers to it in the name of {link:stormwind-city}Stormwind{/link}.
