			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 5238 },
			},
			text = [=[The cauldrons could not be destroyed. The necromancy of {link:kel-thuzad}Kel'Thuzad{/link} was too strong. So Valorfist's second, {link:high-priestess-macdonnell}High Priestess MacDonnell{/link}, planned to change what they brewed. All four western cauldrons were opened, their poisons sampled, and a counter-agent made. When it was done, the commander stood before his camp and bellowed his thanks to the champion who had done it, as a hero of the {link:alliance}Alliance{/link}.]=],
